-----------------------------------
>>>>>>>>> Parser result <<<<<<<<<<<
-----------------------------------

{[1:1:10]} ↦ 1*x+0;
{[1:2:10]} ↦ (1/2)*x+(1/2);
image({[1:1:10]} ↦ 1*x+0);
image({[1:2:50]} ↦ 2*x+1);
image({[1:3:50], [2:3:100]} ↦ 2*x+1);
{[10:1:20]} ↦ x-{[10:1:20]} ↦ -x+30;
{[10:1:20]} ↦ -2*x+50-{[10:1:20]} ↦ x;

-----------------------------------
>>>>>>>>>>> Eval result <<<<<<<<<<<
-----------------------------------

{[1:1:10]} ↦ 1*x+0
  --> {[1:10]} -> x

{[1:2:10]} ↦ (1/2)*x+(1/2)
  --> {[1:2:9]} -> x/2+1/2

image({[1:1:10]} ↦ 1*x+0)
  --> {[1:10]}

image({[1:2:50]} ↦ 2*x+1)
  --> {[3:4:99]}

image({[1:3:50], [2:3:100]} ↦ 2*x+1)
  --> {[3:6:99], [5:6:197]}

{[10:1:20]} ↦ x-{[10:1:20]} ↦ -x+30
  --> {[15:20]} -> 2x-30

{[10:1:20]} ↦ -2*x+50-{[10:1:20]} ↦ x
  --> {[10:16]} -> -3x+50

